  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The README.md  for fcrepo-docker refers to a fcrepo directory on the container filesystem which does not exist. There's no mention of it in the Dockerfile so I presume this is very out of date or we're not packaging everything that the user might expect to find within the container. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
