  "description": "<p>The README.md  for fcrepo-docker refers to a fcrepo directory on the container filesystem which does not exist. There's no mention of it in the Dockerfile so I presume this is very out of date or we're not packaging everything that the user might expect to find within the container. </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/README.md?plain=1#L43\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/main/README.md?plain=1#L43</a></p>",
